  number={},
  pages={1-5},
  abstract={This study examines the utilization of ChatGPT API inside the Unity framework to automate the creation of prompts for Stable Diffusion. This enables the automatic generation of textures and pictures for sprites in Unity. Our technique aims to accelerate the content development process by leveraging ChatGPT's language generation capabilities to generate diverse and contextually appropriate prompts for Stable Diffusion. By conducting experiments and careful examination, we tried to demonstrate the efficacy of our integrated system in producing graphic resources for Unity projects. This work's distinctive contribution lies in the smooth integration of language production with image generation, resulting in more efficient content creation inside the Unity environment. The results of our study suggest that integrating ChatGPT into Unity not only simplifies the process of generating prompts, but also opens up possibilities for creative and dynamic sprite design. The ramifications of this research extend to the fields of computer graphics and game production, offering a novel method for automating and enhancing the visual aspects of virtual worlds.},
